        "Native category is dev-tools: Roboflow is a computer-vision developer platform. Source AI/Developer Tools are not both in the Rust CATEGORIES allowlist.",
        "Official docs now recommend Authorization: Bearer; ?api_key= remains the documented legacy channel and matches the pinned source wire. Native uses query api_key. Hosted inference on detect.roboflow.com / serverless.roboflow.com, workflow POSTs, multipart detect_objects, Prometheus metrics text, and the upstream user-agent are omitted."
